    "order": 5,
    "speaker": "ミラー",
    "normalizedSpeaker": "ミラー",
    "voiceId": "male_main_01",
    "ja": "でも、どうして独身になるんですか。",
    "zh": "可是为什么会变成一个人生活呢？",
    "file": "l31-05.mp3",
    "voice": "male_main_01 / ja-JP-KeitaNeural / rate -10%",
    "duration": 1.386,
    "audioType": "tts-practice"
  },
  {
    "lineId": "l31-conv-006",
    "order": 6,
    "speaker": "小川",
    "normalizedSpeaker": "小川",
    "voiceId": "male_recurring_06",
    "ja": "妻と子どもは東京に残るんです。",
    "zh": "妻子和孩子留在东京。",
    "file": "l31-06.mp3",
    "voice": "male_recurring_06 / ja-JP-KeitaNeural / rate +0%",
    "duration": 1.206,
    "audioType": "tts-practice"
  },
  {
    "lineId": "l31-conv-007",
    "order": 7,
    "speaker": "ミラー",
    "normalizedSpeaker": "ミラー",
    "voiceId": "male_main_01",
    "ja": "えっ、いっしょに行かないんですか。",
    "zh": "咦，他们不一起去吗？",
    "file": "l31-07.mp3",
    "voice": "male_main_01 / ja-JP-KeitaNeural / rate -10%",
    "duration": 1.224,
    "audioType": "tts-practice"
  },
  {
    "lineId": "l31-conv-008",
    "order": 8,
    "speaker": "小川",
    "normalizedSpeaker": "小川",
    "voiceId": "male_recurring_06",
    "ja": "ええ。息子は来年大学の入学試験があるから、東京に残ると言うし、妻も今の会社をやめたくないと言うんです。",
    "zh": "是的，儿子说明年有大学入学考试要留在东京，妻子也说不想辞掉现在的工作。",
